{
  "comment": "Test vectors for the turnkey.io/http-authz/v1 digest format and header binding. 'body': body text (UTF-8) and its digest. 'format': a digest string and whether the profile accepts it (exactly one RFC 9530 member, sha-256=:<standard padded base64>:). 'headers': the bound header name, the received fields in order (lowercase names, as hyper delivers them), the normalized value (lines trimmed of SP and HTAB, joined with ', '), and its digest; a case without 'value' must be rejected. 'header_names': a tk_request.headers list and whether it is valid.",
